# The repo is edited on Windows and built in a Linux container. A shell script
# that arrives with CRLF fails with `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M`, and
# the two under .devcontainer/ break the container itself — so they are pinned
# to LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.m3u8 text eol=lf

# Media fixtures. Note `.ts` is deliberately absent: in this repo it is
# TypeScript, not an MPEG transport stream, and the HLS segments the e2e suite
# generates are gitignored under e2e/.artifacts/.
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
